    "Build original six-project UnitTest graph using unchanged csproj/Directory.Build props/compiler shim, no source configuration edits. Full affected original pool/align/command/editplan/retire/subset/CLI config cases, original IO32+2ENV remain separate not calledgreen. New raw/canonical/source/PDB/binaries bind before real media; old peerCLI14 unchanged not overwritten.",
